+\[
+\lim_{T\to\infty}\frac1T\int_0^T j^{\rm LR}(t)\,dt
+=\frac1{2\pi^2}\,\frac{M\pi^2}{8}\,e_\alpha\cdot e_\beta
+=\frac{M}{16}\,e_\alpha\cdot e_\beta,
+\]
+which proves the result.
 
 
